can't contain arbitrary symbols as documented.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"The stream name cant contain arbitrary symbols as documented\"}, {\"text\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"Stream names are validated against ^[A-Za-z0-9 -]+$ before the agent registers\"}, {\"text\": \"Stream names may contain only letters, digits, spaces and hyphens, and nothing else, or the agent refuses to start.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"Put plainly: letters, digits, spaces and hyphens only, and nothing else, or the agent refuses to start.\"}, {\"text\": \"One customer wanted the stream name left exactly as it stood because that string was the product name in use everywhere in the org.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"one customer wanted the stream name left exactly as it stood because that string was the product name in use everywhere in the org\"}, {\"text\": \"The customer's reporting keyed off the stream name.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"their reporting keyed of it when\"}, {\"text\": \"A way to rename the stream to drop the unsupported symbols will allow the Nimbrel Probe agent to register.\", \"line\": 25, \"span\": \"Rename the stream to drop the unsupported symbols so the Nimbrel Probe agent will register\"}, {\"text\": \"The original name can be carried along as a global tag.\", \"line\": 26, \"span\": \"Then carry the orignal name along as a global tag\"}, {\"text\": \"Carrying the original name as a global tag keeps a link between the real name and the renamed one for each trace.\", \"line\": 26, \"span\": \"so at least each trace keeps a link between the real name and the renamed one\"}]}","ttft_ms":8068,"type":"result","duration_ms":8103,"uuid":"d0d6972a-7f94-434c-9d05-ad72fd482a23","ttft_stream_ms":2130,"time_to_request_ms":95,"first_content_frame_ms":2131,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
